  "details": "HTTP 403 Forbidden seems to be semantically incorrect for scheduled maintenance, the HTTP 503 Service Unavailable response code is made for that. The VRChat Wiki is responding incorrectly.\n\nAffected URL: https://wiki.vrchat.com/\n\nExpected result: HTTP 503 Service Unavailable\n\nActual result: HTTP 403 Forbidden\n\nSee: https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTTP/Reference/Status/503\n\nRelated: https://status.vrchat.com/incidents/xg3n4y6875w6",
